     1,
     "Hi <div>I want to get the output diagram like following diagram. I have tried the following code. A,B,C, and E are observed variables and D is latent variable. </div><div><br></div><div>ECON2&lt;- &#39;<br>#Regression Model<br>D ~ A+B+C<br>E~ 1 + D+A+C<br>&#39;<br></div><div>Error in lavaan::lavaan(model = ECON2, data = c1, <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792418491534000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OfI93f6zZIYkG1KCL4avQ\">std.lv</a> = TRUE, check.gradient = FALSE,  : <br>  lavaan ERROR: missing observed variables in dataset: D<br></div><div><br></div><div>How can I get this output? </div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
